{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plush Rangers</strong> is a fast-paced survivors-like where you assemble a team of <strong>Plushie Friends</strong> to battle quirky mutated enemies and defeat boss monsters. Explore the diverse biomes of <strong>Cosmic Park Swirlstone</strong> and restore <strong>Camp Cloudburst</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/40456bb8827cafcd56e5a98d2ded1b8c.poster.avif?t=1774196995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/40456bb8827cafcd56e5a98d2ded1b8c.webm?t=1774196995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/40456bb8827cafcd56e5a98d2ded1b8c.mp4?t=1774196995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Plushie Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plushie has unique abilities and behaviors\u2014from the defensive <strong>Brocco</strong>, who repels nearby enemies, to <strong>Tangelo</strong>, a charging berserker tortoise. Level up your plushies to boost their power and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/a5b81f7990d05a91f840cb8a97e50e3e.poster.avif?t=1774196995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/a5b81f7990d05a91f840cb8a97e50e3e.webm?t=1774196995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/a5b81f7990d05a91f840cb8a97e50e3e.mp4?t=1774196995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Toasters, Staplers, Rubber Duckies and more</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Plush Rangers is filled with a quirky cast of friends and foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/af84e8f8c1b1d2c27fdb867abf884843.poster.avif?t=1774196995\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/af84e8f8c1b1d2c27fdb867abf884843.webm?t=1774196995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/af84e8f8c1b1d2c27fdb867abf884843.mp4?t=1774196995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>6 different characters</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Customize your character with a specialized ranger gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Collect 50+ unique plushies</i></strong> - Each plushie has a different ability.\u00a0 Level them up to discover new synergies between your plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Achieve 150+ badges</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Each badge unlocks additional content, challenges, or improved capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Discover 75+ relic artifacts</strong> -</i> Relics provide bonuses and abilities during your run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593330?t=1774196995","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593330?t=177419699